{"id":"1t-1-3","courseId":"1t","chapterNumber":"1.3","title":"Algebra","description":"Lær om bokstavrekningom, parentesrekningom og multiplikasjon av parentesar.","estimatedMinutes":60,"competenceGoals":["behandla og faktorisera algebraiske uttrykk"],"content":[{"id":"1t-1-3-intro","type":"text","content":"# Bokstavrekningom\n\nI algebra brukar vi bokstavar som representerer tal. Når vi reknar med bokstavar, kan vi berre leggja saman eller trekkja frå **like ledd** - det vil seia ledd som inneheld dei same bokstavane med dei same eksponentane."},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-1","type":"example","title":"Døme 1","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $3a + 5a + a$\nb) $3a + 7a - 5b$\nc) $2x^2 - 5x + 3x + 4x^2 + 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $3a + 5a + a = {\\color{blue}8a + 1a} = 9a$\n\nb) $3a + 7a - 5b = 10a - 5b$\n\nc) $2x^2 - 5x + 3x + 4x^2 + 2 = {\\color{blue}2x^2 + 4x^2 - 5x + 3x + 2} = 6x^2 - 2x + 2$","solutionVideo":"QWyUm2QQg80"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$5x + 2x + x$","solution":"$5x + 2x + x = 8x$","expressionAnswer":"8x"},{"label":"b","task":"$7x + 8x - 2y$","solution":"$7x + 8x - 2y = 15x - 2y$","expressionAnswer":"15x-2y"},{"label":"c","task":"$27x + 9y - 12x$","solution":"$27x + 9y - 12x = 15x + 9y$","expressionAnswer":"15x+9y"},{"label":"d","task":"$9x^2 + 7x^2 + 3x$","solution":"$9x^2 + 7x^2 + 3x = 16x^2 + 3x$","expressionAnswer":"16x^2+3x"},{"label":"e","task":"$5x^2 + 7x + 9 - 2x^2$","solution":"$5x^2 + 7x + 9 - 2x^2 = 3x^2 + 7x + 9$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2+7x+9"},{"label":"f","task":"$9x^3 + 8x - 2x^3 + 5$","solution":"$9x^3 + 8x - 2x^3 + 5 = 7x^3 + 8x + 5$","expressionAnswer":"7x^3+8x+5"}],"hints":["Like ledd har same bokstav med same eksponent. Berre like ledd kan leggast saman."],"solution":"a) $8x$, b) $15x - 2y$, c) $15x + 9y$, d) $16x^2 + 3x$, e) $3x^2 + 7x + 9$, f) $7x^3 + 8x + 5$","solutionVideo":"0f-MeXnuNG8","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-2","type":"example","title":"Døme 2","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2xy + 3yx$\nb) $2xy + 5yx + 3xz$\nc) $3x^2y + 5xy^2 - 4yx^2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2xy + 3{\\color{blue}yx} = 2xy + 3{\\color{blue}xy} = 5xy$\n\nb) $2xy + 5{\\color{blue}yx} + 3xz = 2xy + 5{\\color{blue}xy} + 3xz = 7xy + 3xz$\n\nc) $3x^2y + 5xy^2 - 4{\\color{blue}yx^2} = 3x^2y - 4{\\color{blue}x^2y} + 5xy^2 = -x^2y + 5xy^2$","solutionVideo":"tz-8hvOeXp0"},{"id":"1t-1-3-tip-1","type":"tip","content":"**NB: Alfabetisk rekkjefølgje**\n\nVi set faktorane i alfabetisk rekkjefølgje:\n\n$yx = y \\cdot x = x \\cdot y = xy$"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3xz + 7zx$","solution":"$3xz + 7zx = 10xz$","expressionAnswer":"10xz"},{"label":"b","task":"$7xy + 8xy - 2y^2$","solution":"$7xy + 8xy - 2y^2 = -2y^2 + 15xy$","expressionAnswer":"15xy-2y^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$2xz^2 + 9xz^2 - 12xz$","solution":"$2xz^2 + 9xz^2 - 12xz = 11xz^2 - 12xz$","expressionAnswer":"11xz^2-12xz"},{"label":"d","task":"$Ab - 7Ab + 3bA$","solution":"$Ab - 7Ab + 3bA = -3Ab$","expressionAnswer":"-3Ab"},{"label":"e","task":"$x^2y + 7x - 2x^2y$","solution":"$x^2y + 7x - 2x^2y = -x^2y + 7x$","expressionAnswer":"-x^2y+7x"},{"label":"f","task":"$x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2 + 3x^2$","solution":"$x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2 + 3x^2 = 4x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2$","expressionAnswer":"4x^2+y^2-2xy^2"}],"hints":["Husk at $xy = yx$ og $Ab = bA$. Sorter ledda slik at like ledd står ved sida av kvarandre."],"solution":"a) $10xz$, b) $-2y^2 + 15xy$, c) $11xz^2 - 12xz$, d) $-3Ab$, e) $-x^2y + 7x$, f) $4x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2$","solutionVideo":"JX-5TVE79Kc","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-section-parentes","type":"text","content":"# Parentesrekning\n\nNår vi multipliserer med parentesar, bruker vi distributiv lov."},{"id":"1t-1-3-theorem-1","type":"theorem","title":"Multiplikasjon med parentesar","content":"$$a \\cdot (b + c) = a \\cdot b + a \\cdot c$$\n\n$$a \\cdot (b + c + d) = a \\cdot b + a \\cdot c + a \\cdot d$$"},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-3","type":"example","title":"Døme 3","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2(x + 4)$\nb) $-3(2x - 2)$\nc) $x(x^2 - 3y + 2)$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2(x + 4) = {\\color{blue}2 \\cdot (x + 4) = 2 \\cdot x + 2 \\cdot 4} = 2x + 8$\n\nb) $-3(2x - 2) = {\\color{blue}-3 \\cdot 2x - (-3) \\cdot 2 = -6x - (-6)} = -6x + 6$\n\nc) $x(x^2 - 3y + 2) = {\\color{blue}x \\cdot x^2 - x \\cdot 3y + x \\cdot 2} = x^3 - 3xy + 2x$","solutionVideo":"GUWJxFiV5ps"},{"id":"1t-1-3-tip-2","type":"tip","content":"**Potensregelen:**\n\n$x \\cdot x^2 = x^1 \\cdot x^2 = x^{1+2} = x^3$\n\nGenerelt: $x^n \\cdot x^m = x^{n+m}$"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2(x - 3)$","solution":"$2(x - 3) = 2x - 6$","expressionAnswer":"2x-6"},{"label":"b","task":"$-4(-y + 3)$","solution":"$-4(-y + 3) = 4y - 12$","expressionAnswer":"4y-12"},{"label":"c","task":"$x(x - 3) + x$","solution":"$x(x - 3) + x = x^2 - 3x + x = x^2 - 2x$","expressionAnswer":"x^2-2x"},{"label":"d","task":"$-2(x^2 - 3x + 2) - x^2$","solution":"$-2(x^2 - 3x + 2) - x^2 = -2x^2 + 6x - 4 - x^2 = -3x^2 + 6x - 4$","expressionAnswer":"-3x^2+6x-4"},{"label":"e","task":"$-2 - 3(x^2 - 3) - 2x$","solution":"$-2 - 3(x^2 - 3) - 2x = -2 - 3x^2 + 9 - 2x = -3x^2 - 2x + 7$","expressionAnswer":"-3x^2-2x+7"},{"label":"f","task":"$-y(2y^3 + x)$","solution":"$-y(2y^3 + x) = -2y^4 - xy$","expressionAnswer":"-2y^4-xy"}],"hints":["Husk at $-a \\cdot (-b) = ab$ og $-a \\cdot b = -ab$"],"solution":"a) $2x - 6$, b) $4y - 12$, c) $x^2 - 2x$, d) $-3x^2 + 6x - 4$, e) $-3x^2 - 2x + 7$, f) $-2y^4 - xy$","solutionVideo":"9Lv8eL_s0t8","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-4","type":"example","title":"Døme 4","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2a + (2a - 3b)$\nb) $3a - (5b - 4a)$\nc) $-(-3x + 2) + 8x$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2a + (2a - 3b) = 2a + 2a - 3b = 4a - 3b$\n\nb) $3a - {\\color{blue}1}(5b - 4a) = 3a - 5b + 4a = 7a - 5b$\n\nc) $\\color{blue}{-1}(-3x + 2) + 8x = 3x - 2 + 8x = 11x - 2$","solutionVideo":"F5RMjsdYm9s"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2x + (5x - 2)$","solution":"$2x + (5x - 2) = 2x + 5x - 2 = 7x - 2$","expressionAnswer":"7x-2"},{"label":"b","task":"$4y - (2y + 3)$","solution":"$4y - (2y + 3) = 4y - 2y - 3 = 2y - 3$","expressionAnswer":"2y-3"},{"label":"c","task":"$-(2x - 3) + 2x$","solution":"$-(2x - 3) + 2x = -2x + 3 + 2x = 3$","answer":3},{"label":"d","task":"$(2x^2 + 3) - (4x^2 + 5)$","solution":"$(2x^2 + 3) - (4x^2 + 5) = 2x^2 + 3 - 4x^2 - 5 = -2x^2 - 2$","expressionAnswer":"-2x^2-2"},{"label":"e","task":"$-10 + (x^2 - 3) - 2$","solution":"$-10 + (x^2 - 3) - 2 = -10 + x^2 - 3 - 2 = x^2 - 15$","expressionAnswer":"x^2-15"},{"label":"f","task":"$-xy - (-3xy + 1)$","solution":"$-xy - (-3xy + 1) = -xy + 3xy - 1 = 2xy - 1$","expressionAnswer":"2xy-1"}],"hints":["Minus foran parentesar endrar forteikn på alle ledd inne i parentesen: $-(a - b) = -a + b$"],"solution":"a) $7x - 2$, b) $2y - 3$, c) $3$, d) $-2x^2 - 2$, e) $x^2 - 15$, f) $2xy - 1$","solutionVideo":"X1CBIcgv9sk","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-5","type":"example","title":"Døme 5","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $xy(x^2 + y + 2)$\nb) $a^2b(a^2 - 2b)$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $xy(x^2 + y + 2) = {\\color{blue}xy \\cdot x^2 + xy \\cdot y + xy \\cdot 2} = x^3y + xy^2 + 2xy$\n\nb) $a^2b(a^2 - 2b) = {\\color{blue}a^2b \\cdot a^2 - a^2b \\cdot 2b} = a^4b - 2a^2b^2$","solutionVideo":"H95YSX_5Mdc"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2x(x - y)$","solution":"$2x(x - y) = 2x^2 - 2xy$","expressionAnswer":"2x^2-2xy"},{"label":"b","task":"$-x(-y + 3)$","solution":"$-x(-y + 3) = xy - 3x$","expressionAnswer":"xy-3x"},{"label":"c","task":"$xy(x - 2)$","solution":"$xy(x - 2) = x^2y - 2xy$","expressionAnswer":"x^2y-2xy"},{"label":"d","task":"$-a(b^2 - a + 4) - a^2$","solution":"$-a(b^2 - a + 4) - a^2 = -ab^2 + a^2 - 4a - a^2 = -ab^2 - 4a$","expressionAnswer":"-ab^2-4a"},{"label":"e","task":"$-3y(x^2 - 3x) - 2yx$","solution":"$-3y(x^2 - 3x) - 2yx = -3x^2y + 9xy - 2xy = -3x^2y + 7xy$","expressionAnswer":"-3x^2y+7xy"},{"label":"f","task":"$-u(v^3 + u)$","solution":"$-u(v^3 + u) = -uv^3 - u^2 = -u^2 - uv^3$","expressionAnswer":"-u^2-uv^3"}],"hints":["Multipliser kvart ledd inne i parentesen med faktoren utanfor"],"solution":"a) $2x^2 - 2xy$, b) $xy - 3x$, c) $x^2y - 2xy$, d) $-ab^2 - 4a$, e) $-3x^2y + 7xy$, f) $-u^2 - uv^3$","solutionVideo":"GWOCmYUrrjI","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-section-mult","type":"text","content":"# Multiplikasjon av parentesar\n\nNår vi multipliserer to parentesar, må kvart ledd i den første parentesen multipliserast med kvart ledd i den andre."},{"id":"1t-1-3-theorem-2","type":"theorem","title":"Multiplikasjon av to parentesar","content":"$$(a + b) \\cdot (c + d) = a \\cdot c + a \\cdot d + b \\cdot c + b \\cdot d$$"},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-6","type":"example","title":"Døme 6","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $(x + 2)(x + 3)$\nb) $-2(x + 3)(x - 5)$\nc) $(2x - 3)(3y - 5)$\nd) $(2x + y)(3x - 2y)$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $({\\color{red}x} + 2)({\\color{green}x} + 3) = {\\color{red}x} \\cdot {\\color{green}x} + {\\color{red}x} \\cdot 3 + 2 \\cdot {\\color{green}x} + 2 \\cdot 3 = x^2 + 3x + 2x + 6$\n$= x^2 + 5x + 6$\n\nb) $-2(x + 3)(x - 5) = {\\color{blue}-2(x \\cdot x + x \\cdot (-5) + 3 \\cdot x + 3 \\cdot (-5))}$\n$= -2(x^2 - 5x + 3x - 15) = -2(x^2 - 2x - 15)$\n$= -2x^2 + 4x + 30$\n\nc) $(2x - 3)(3y - 5) = {\\color{blue}2x \\cdot 3y + 2x \\cdot (-5) - 3 \\cdot 3y - 3 \\cdot (-5)}$\n$= 6xy - 10x - 9y + 15$\n\nd) $(2x + y)(3x - 2y) = {\\color{blue}2x \\cdot 3x + 2x \\cdot (-2y) + y \\cdot 3x + y \\cdot (-2y)}$\n$= 6x^2 - 4xy + 3xy - 2y^2 = 6x^2 - xy - 2y^2$","solutionVideo":"EyxGHxxOoAM"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$(x + 3)(x + 4)$","solution":"$(x + 3)(x + 4) = x^2 + 4x + 3x + 12 = x^2 + 7x + 12$","expressionAnswer":"x^2+7x+12"},{"label":"b","task":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)$","solution":"$(x + 3)(x - 2) = x^2 - 2x + 3x - 6 = x^2 + x - 6$","expressionAnswer":"x^2+x-6"},{"label":"c","task":"$(2x + 4)(x - y)$","solution":"$(2x + 4)(x - y) = 2x^2 - 2xy + 4x - 4y$","expressionAnswer":"2x^2-2xy+4x-4y"},{"label":"d","task":"$-2(2x - 2)(x - 5)$","solution":"$-2(2x - 2)(x - 5) = -2(2x^2 - 10x - 2x + 10) = -2(2x^2 - 12x + 10) = -4x^2 + 24x - 20$","expressionAnswer":"-4x^2+24x-20"},{"label":"e","task":"$-(x + y)(x - 3)$","solution":"$-(x + y)(x - 3) = -(x^2 - 3x + xy - 3y) = -x^2 + 3x - xy + 3y$","expressionAnswer":"-x^2+3x-xy+3y"},{"label":"f","task":"$3(2x + 3y)(2y + x)$","solution":"$3(2x + 3y)(2y + x) = 3(4xy + 2x^2 + 6y^2 + 3xy) = 3(2x^2 + 7xy + 6y^2) = 6x^2 + 21xy + 18y^2$","expressionAnswer":"6x^2+21xy+18y^2"}],"hints":["Multipliser kvart ledd i første parentes med kvart ledd i andre parentes"],"solution":"a) $x^2 + 7x + 12$, b) $x^2 + x - 6$, c) $2x^2 - 2xy + 4x - 4y$, d) $-4x^2 + 24x - 20$, e) $-x^2 + 3x - xy + 3y$, f) $6x^2 + 21xy + 18y^2$","solutionVideo":"YVo4tGLs1MI","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-example-7","type":"example","title":"Eksempel 7","problem":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 4)$\nb) $x(x + 3)(x - 5)$\nc) $(x - 2)(x - 3)(2x - 5)$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 4) = x^2 - (x^2 + 4x + 2x + 8)$\n$= x^2 - x^2 - 4x - 2x - 8 = -6x - 8$\n\nb) $x(x + 3)(x - 5) = (x^2 + 3x)(x - 5) = x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x^2 - 15x$\n$= x^3 - 2x^2 - 15x$\n\nc) $(x - 2)(x - 3)(2x - 5) = (x - 2)(2x^2 - 5x - 6x + 15)$\n$= (x - 2)(2x^2 - 11x + 15) = 2x^3 - 11x^2 + 15x - 4x^2 + 22x - 30$\n$= 2x^3 - 15x^2 + 37x - 30$","solutionVideo":"u6pHNWi9eMM"},{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$x(x + 3)(x + 4)$","solution":"$x(x + 3)(x + 4) = (x^2 + 3x)(x + 4) = x^3 + 4x^2 + 3x^2 + 12x = x^3 + 7x^2 + 12x$","expressionAnswer":"x^3+7x^2+12x"},{"label":"b","task":"$x^2 - (x + 4)(x - 1)$","solution":"$x^2 - (x + 4)(x - 1) = x^2 - (x^2 - x + 4x - 4) = x^2 - x^2 + x - 4x + 4 = -3x + 4$","expressionAnswer":"-3x+4"},{"label":"c","task":"$(x + 4)(x - 2)(x - 5)$","solution":"$(x + 4)(x - 2)(x - 5) = (x^2 + 2x - 8)(x - 5) = x^3 - 5x^2 + 2x^2 - 10x - 8x + 40 = x^3 - 3x^2 - 18x + 40$","expressionAnswer":"x^3-3x^2-18x+40"},{"label":"d","task":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)(-5)$","solution":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)(-5) = -5(x^2 + x - 6) = -5x^2 - 5x + 30$","expressionAnswer":"-5x^2-5x+30"},{"label":"e","task":"$-x^3 - (x + 5)(x - 3)x$","solution":"$-x^3 - (x + 5)(x - 3)x = -x^3 - (x^2 + 2x - 15)x = -x^3 - x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x = -2x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x$","expressionAnswer":"-2x^3-2x^2+15x"},{"label":"f","task":"$x^3 - 2x - (x - 2)(x + 3)(2 + x)$","solution":"$x^3 - 2x - (x - 2)(x + 3)(2 + x) = x^3 - 2x - (x^2 + x - 6)(x + 2) = x^3 - 2x - (x^3 + 3x^2 - 4x - 12) = -3x^2 + 2x + 12$","expressionAnswer":"-3x^2+2x+12"}],"hints":["Ta éin parentes om gongen. Multipliser først to parentesar, så gangar du resultatet med den tredje."],"solution":"a) $x^3 + 7x^2 + 12x$, b) $-3x + 4$, c) $x^3 - 3x^2 - 18x + 40$, d) $-5x^2 - 5x + 30$, e) $-2x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x$, f) $-3x^2 + 2x + 12$","solutionVideo":"pC11xCI1nLo","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","content":[{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$15x + 22x$","expressionAnswer":"37x"},{"label":"b","task":"$12x - 4x - 20x$","expressionAnswer":"-12x"},{"label":"c","task":"$7x + 3y - 13x + 3$","expressionAnswer":"-6x+3y+3"},{"label":"d","task":"$9a + b - 31a$","expressionAnswer":"-22a+b"},{"label":"e","task":"$15x + 7q + 18 - 2$","expressionAnswer":"15x+7q+16"},{"label":"f","task":"$-8 - 2x - 5y - 7y$","expressionAnswer":"-2x-12y-8"}],"solution":"a) $37x$, b) $-12x$, c) $-6x + 3y + 3$, d) $-22a + b$, e) $15x + 7q + 16$, f) $-2x - 12y - 8$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Saml like ledd - ledd med same bokstav og eksponent."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-2-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-2-1","number":"R2.1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$4x^2 + 2x^2$","expressionAnswer":"6x^2"},{"label":"b","task":"$2x^2 + 5x^2 - 2x$","expressionAnswer":"7x^2-2x"},{"label":"c","task":"$7xy + 3xy - 12x$","expressionAnswer":"10xy-12x"},{"label":"d","task":"$2ab + 7ba + 3a$","expressionAnswer":"9ab+3a"},{"label":"e","task":"$5b^2 + 2a^2b - 6a^2b$","expressionAnswer":"-4a^2b+5b^2"},{"label":"f","task":"$-9xy + 8x^2 - 2x^2$","expressionAnswer":"6x^2-9xy"}],"solution":"a) $6x^2$, b) $7x^2 - 2x$, c) $10xy - 12x$, d) $9ab + 3a$, e) $-4a^2b + 5b^2$, f) $6x^2 - 9xy$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Hugs at $ab = ba$. Saml like ledd."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-2-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-2-2","number":"R2.2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3x^2 + 5x - 2x^2 + 7x - 3$","expressionAnswer":"x^2+12x-3"},{"label":"b","task":"$7y^2 - 8x + 3x^2 - 7x + 9y^2$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2-15x+16y^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$2xy + 15xy - x^2 + 3xy$","expressionAnswer":"-x^2+20xy"},{"label":"d","task":"$8a - 3c + 2a^2 - 15c - 6a$","expressionAnswer":"2a^2+2a-18c"},{"label":"e","task":"$8ba - ab + 3a^2 - 9a^2 - 18ab$","expressionAnswer":"-6a^2-11ab"},{"label":"f","task":"$3x^2y + 10x^2y - 5x^2 + 2y^2 - 2x^2y$","expressionAnswer":"-5x^2+11x^2y+2y^2"}],"solution":"a) $x^2 + 12x - 3$, b) $3x^2 - 15x + 16y^2$, c) $-x^2 + 20xy$, d) $2a^2 + 2a - 18c$, e) $-6a^2 - 11ab$, f) $-5x^2 + 11x^2y + 2y^2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Sorter ledda først, så blir det lettare å sjå kva som er like."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$5(x + 2)$","expressionAnswer":"5x+10"},{"label":"b","task":"$-2(y - 8)$","expressionAnswer":"-2y+16"},{"label":"c","task":"$2(2x - 3) + 5$","expressionAnswer":"4x-1"},{"label":"d","task":"$-3(x - 2) + 2x$","expressionAnswer":"-x+6"},{"label":"e","task":"$-5(-2x + 2) + 2(x - 1)$","expressionAnswer":"12x-12"},{"label":"f","task":"$(x - 3) \\cdot 3$","expressionAnswer":"3x-9"}],"solution":"a) $5x + 10$, b) $-2y + 16$, c) $4x - 1$, d) $-x + 6$, e) $12x - 12$, f) $3x - 9$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Bruk distributiv lov: $a(b + c) = ab + ac$"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3(3x - 3 + y)$","expressionAnswer":"9x-9+3y"},{"label":"b","task":"$-4(2y - 2x - 5)$","expressionAnswer":"8x-8y+20"},{"label":"c","task":"$4(2x - 3 - 6y) + 5$","expressionAnswer":"8x-24y-7"}],"solution":"a) $9x - 9 + 3y$, b) $8x - 8y + 20$, c) $8x - 24y - 7$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Multipliser kvart ledd inne i parentesen med faktoren utanfor."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3x^2(y - x)$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2y-3x^3"},{"label":"b","task":"$-3x(-x + 3)$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2-9x"},{"label":"c","task":"$x^3(x^2 - 3x)$","expressionAnswer":"x^5-3x^4"},{"label":"d","task":"$-3l(l^2 - 2l) - 2k$","expressionAnswer":"-3l^3+6l^2-2k"},{"label":"e","task":"$b(-b^2 - b + 4) - b^2$","expressionAnswer":"-b^3-2b^2+4b"},{"label":"f","task":"$-(x^2 - b)(x + b)$","expressionAnswer":"-x^3-bx^2+bx+b^2"}],"solution":"a) $3x^2y - 3x^3$, b) $3x^2 - 9x$, c) $x^5 - 3x^4$, d) $-3l^3 + 6l^2 - 2k$, e) $-b^3 - 2b^2 + 4b$, f) $-x^3 - bx^2 + bx + b^2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Bruk potensregelen $x^a \\cdot x^b = x^{a+b}$"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-6","number":"R6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$(x + 2)(x + 5)$","expressionAnswer":"x^2+7x+10"},{"label":"b","task":"$(x - 3)(x - 4)$","expressionAnswer":"x^2-7x+12"},{"label":"c","task":"$3(x + 1)(x + 2)$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2+9x+6"},{"label":"d","task":"$(2x + 1)(3x + 2)$","expressionAnswer":"6x^2+7x+2"},{"label":"e","task":"$2(2x - 2)(x + 5)$","expressionAnswer":"4x^2+16x-20"},{"label":"f","task":"$-(x - 3)(y - 9)$","expressionAnswer":"-xy+9x+3y-27"}],"solution":"a) $x^2 + 7x + 10$, b) $x^2 - 7x + 12$, c) $3x^2 + 9x + 6$, d) $6x^2 + 7x + 2$, e) $4x^2 + 16x - 20$, f) $-xy + 9x + 3y - 27$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["$(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd$"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-3-rep-ex-7","number":"R7","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$x(x + 2)(x + 1)$","expressionAnswer":"x^3+3x^2+2x"},{"label":"b","task":"$x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 2)$","expressionAnswer":"-4x-4"},{"label":"c","task":"$(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 1)$","expressionAnswer":"x^3+5x^2+7x+3"},{"label":"d","task":"$(x + 5)(x + 3) \\cdot 3$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2+24x+45"},{"label":"e","task":"$-2(x - 1)(3x + 6)$","expressionAnswer":"-6x^2-6x+12"},{"label":"f","task":"$10 - (x + 4)(y - 2)$","expressionAnswer":"-xy+2x-4y+18"}],"solution":"a) $x^3 + 3x^2 + 2x$, b) $-4x - 4$, c) $x^3 + 5x^2 + 7x + 3$, d) $3x^2 + 24x + 45$, e) $-6x^2 - 6x + 12$, f) $-xy + 2x - 4y + 18$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Ta éin parentes om gangen. Start med å multiplisere to parentesar først."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]},{"id":"1t-1-3-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\n- **Likeledd:** Berre ledd med same bokstav(ar) og same eksponent kan leggjast saman: $3x + 5x = 8x$, men $3x + 5y$ kan ikkje forenklazt\n- **Alfabetisk rekkjefølgje:** Vi skriv faktorane alfabetisk: $yx = xy$ og $ba = ab$\n- **Distributiv lov:** $a(b + c) = ab + ac$ - vi gangar faktoren utanfor parentesen med kvart ledd inne i parentesen\n- **Minus framfor parentes:** $-(a - b) = -a + b$ - alle forteikn inne i parentesen endras\n- **Multiplikasjon av to parentesar:** $(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd$ - kvart ledd i første parentes blir multiplisert med kvart ledd i andre parentes\n- **Potensregel:** $x^n \\cdot x^m = x^{n+m}$"}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"99eb256f231b8b79","translatedAt":"2026-06-16T09:59:02.013Z","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","strings":210,"tm":{"578caa841399737c":"Algebra","d70c77306face651":"Lær om bokstavrekningom, parentesrekningom og multiplikasjon av parentesar.","be1dc44d3d82bda8":"behandla og faktorisera algebraiske uttrykk","c3cfc42231acb7ba":"# Bokstavrekningom\n\nI algebra brukar vi bokstavar som representerer tal. Når vi reknar med bokstavar, kan vi berre leggja saman eller trekkja frå **like ledd** - det vil seia ledd som inneheld dei same bokstavane med dei same eksponentane.","58916c7752f6e6c9":"Døme 1","54f37a0aad96ad19":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $3a + 5a + a$\nb) $3a + 7a - 5b$\nc) $2x^2 - 5x + 3x + 4x^2 + 2$","d3b240524bd181f3":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $3a + 5a + a = {\\color{blue}8a + 1a} = 9a$\n\nb) $3a + 7a - 5b = 10a - 5b$\n\nc) $2x^2 - 5x + 3x + 4x^2 + 2 = {\\color{blue}2x^2 + 4x^2 - 5x + 3x + 2} = 6x^2 - 2x + 2$","f703a1ce44142f5b":"Rekn ut","a4dbe638766f3cec":"$5x + 2x + x$","2e4ba178e2f06c6c":"$5x + 2x + x = 8x$","b76fb7dfda74690a":"$7x + 8x - 2y$","0e2ed068524fba0b":"$7x + 8x - 2y = 15x - 2y$","560f1613449832a6":"$27x + 9y - 12x$","5d27ff737ca2e27b":"$27x + 9y - 12x = 15x + 9y$","0edf0e35688c3f5e":"$9x^2 + 7x^2 + 3x$","8f42fbeaa61f7cd1":"$9x^2 + 7x^2 + 3x = 16x^2 + 3x$","79ccac87cdd98898":"$5x^2 + 7x + 9 - 2x^2$","ac6d7346a87197b2":"$5x^2 + 7x + 9 - 2x^2 = 3x^2 + 7x + 9$","be1676dba799d491":"$9x^3 + 8x - 2x^3 + 5$","af24d37d454e3b5a":"$9x^3 + 8x - 2x^3 + 5 = 7x^3 + 8x + 5$","040fdc33fd1e59f8":"Like ledd har same bokstav med same eksponent. Berre like ledd kan leggast saman.","883baa588f639054":"a) $8x$, b) $15x - 2y$, c) $15x + 9y$, d) $16x^2 + 3x$, e) $3x^2 + 7x + 9$, f) $7x^3 + 8x + 5$","0dcdf90952edec99":"Døme 2","ecdd84b132d32199":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2xy + 3yx$\nb) $2xy + 5yx + 3xz$\nc) $3x^2y + 5xy^2 - 4yx^2$","f4f4fa1d1a978868":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2xy + 3{\\color{blue}yx} = 2xy + 3{\\color{blue}xy} = 5xy$\n\nb) $2xy + 5{\\color{blue}yx} + 3xz = 2xy + 5{\\color{blue}xy} + 3xz = 7xy + 3xz$\n\nc) $3x^2y + 5xy^2 - 4{\\color{blue}yx^2} = 3x^2y - 4{\\color{blue}x^2y} + 5xy^2 = -x^2y + 5xy^2$","9318048d938bd4e8":"**NB: Alfabetisk rekkjefølgje**\n\nVi set faktorane i alfabetisk rekkjefølgje:\n\n$yx = y \\cdot x = x \\cdot y = xy$","c4de4efca45676ad":"$3xz + 7zx$","d876b1fcfc5fa1d2":"$3xz + 7zx = 10xz$","7814dd214513f635":"$7xy + 8xy - 2y^2$","da4742cedc215f01":"$7xy + 8xy - 2y^2 = -2y^2 + 15xy$","92b438e03ee6a8a4":"$2xz^2 + 9xz^2 - 12xz$","e969b408025438a4":"$2xz^2 + 9xz^2 - 12xz = 11xz^2 - 12xz$","ded7b4fe6664728a":"$Ab - 7Ab + 3bA$","f97c76550b78f3b4":"$Ab - 7Ab + 3bA = -3Ab$","d8a0cbd598973c19":"$x^2y + 7x - 2x^2y$","b8aa2eae00909570":"$x^2y + 7x - 2x^2y = -x^2y + 7x$","fc679d7d3ce51b32":"$x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2 + 3x^2$","304d658eefc6d0ba":"$x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2 + 3x^2 = 4x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2$","7088b1dfb50c4fbd":"Husk at $xy = yx$ og $Ab = bA$. Sorter ledda slik at like ledd står ved sida av kvarandre.","10862225530fb829":"a) $10xz$, b) $-2y^2 + 15xy$, c) $11xz^2 - 12xz$, d) $-3Ab$, e) $-x^2y + 7x$, f) $4x^2 + y^2 - 2xy^2$","0d5d2069128b5ff9":"# Parentesrekning\n\nNår vi multipliserer med parentesar, bruker vi distributiv lov.","01fec9cc7a71c3c9":"Multiplikasjon med parentesar","c49e75724f2a0ef1":"$$a \\cdot (b + c) = a \\cdot b + a \\cdot c$$\n\n$$a \\cdot (b + c + d) = a \\cdot b + a \\cdot c + a \\cdot d$$","24420a2392249d81":"Døme 3","45d26092a06e1de9":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2(x + 4)$\nb) $-3(2x - 2)$\nc) $x(x^2 - 3y + 2)$","6ea845b35ebba363":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2(x + 4) = {\\color{blue}2 \\cdot (x + 4) = 2 \\cdot x + 2 \\cdot 4} = 2x + 8$\n\nb) $-3(2x - 2) = {\\color{blue}-3 \\cdot 2x - (-3) \\cdot 2 = -6x - (-6)} = -6x + 6$\n\nc) $x(x^2 - 3y + 2) = {\\color{blue}x \\cdot x^2 - x \\cdot 3y + x \\cdot 2} = x^3 - 3xy + 2x$","7c07c9e868057f9c":"**Potensregelen:**\n\n$x \\cdot x^2 = x^1 \\cdot x^2 = x^{1+2} = x^3$\n\nGenerelt: $x^n \\cdot x^m = x^{n+m}$","37e905de0a812eca":"$2(x - 3)$","7d9ed85cdd5d9814":"$2(x - 3) = 2x - 6$","a2f6e75c5032147e":"$-4(-y + 3)$","df32aa9d5e8abcaf":"$-4(-y + 3) = 4y - 12$","081a1682bf6498a2":"$x(x - 3) + x$","1288b7d59d22bfba":"$x(x - 3) + x = x^2 - 3x + x = x^2 - 2x$","0d8e276b6971f4e6":"$-2(x^2 - 3x + 2) - x^2$","ec0a58f576e4bfbd":"$-2(x^2 - 3x + 2) - x^2 = -2x^2 + 6x - 4 - x^2 = -3x^2 + 6x - 4$","ec53bb7ae1a30d35":"$-2 - 3(x^2 - 3) - 2x$","c8c30cb168ab0971":"$-2 - 3(x^2 - 3) - 2x = -2 - 3x^2 + 9 - 2x = -3x^2 - 2x + 7$","dcfe2783af81191e":"$-y(2y^3 + x)$","ea4c706b9a0bf650":"$-y(2y^3 + x) = -2y^4 - xy$","2fab1f2a95468c44":"Husk at $-a \\cdot (-b) = ab$ og $-a \\cdot b = -ab$","4263171d1363c038":"a) $2x - 6$, b) $4y - 12$, c) $x^2 - 2x$, d) $-3x^2 + 6x - 4$, e) $-3x^2 - 2x + 7$, f) $-2y^4 - xy$","252546d9ba5d4c16":"Døme 4","a8427e15985468c4":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $2a + (2a - 3b)$\nb) $3a - (5b - 4a)$\nc) $-(-3x + 2) + 8x$","e8b176d6a6f95214":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $2a + (2a - 3b) = 2a + 2a - 3b = 4a - 3b$\n\nb) $3a - {\\color{blue}1}(5b - 4a) = 3a - 5b + 4a = 7a - 5b$\n\nc) $\\color{blue}{-1}(-3x + 2) + 8x = 3x - 2 + 8x = 11x - 2$","3b684d7baa183f80":"$2x + (5x - 2)$","5aa6b953380f1c74":"$2x + (5x - 2) = 2x + 5x - 2 = 7x - 2$","1fdeb573a26c28ab":"$4y - (2y + 3)$","5078c118ffb2fbef":"$4y - (2y + 3) = 4y - 2y - 3 = 2y - 3$","a2a5b205e8ff968e":"$-(2x - 3) + 2x$","4712849c0641907d":"$-(2x - 3) + 2x = -2x + 3 + 2x = 3$","211e8fcc5a4ff10a":"$(2x^2 + 3) - (4x^2 + 5)$","9ce651ec13a90cf7":"$(2x^2 + 3) - (4x^2 + 5) = 2x^2 + 3 - 4x^2 - 5 = -2x^2 - 2$","58a7f5340e1a66a1":"$-10 + (x^2 - 3) - 2$","5f44cfd1f916390d":"$-10 + (x^2 - 3) - 2 = -10 + x^2 - 3 - 2 = x^2 - 15$","7ffdca543e07980f":"$-xy - (-3xy + 1)$","89903e7be5f3c29f":"$-xy - (-3xy + 1) = -xy + 3xy - 1 = 2xy - 1$","d866e4eea5d80141":"Minus foran parentesar endrar forteikn på alle ledd inne i parentesen: $-(a - b) = -a + b$","9a6b46bc9c58766e":"a) $7x - 2$, b) $2y - 3$, c) $3$, d) $-2x^2 - 2$, e) $x^2 - 15$, f) $2xy - 1$","1f132a17820f95bc":"Døme 5","9bc8884d810e933e":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $xy(x^2 + y + 2)$\nb) $a^2b(a^2 - 2b)$","44b67888e9a8eef4":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $xy(x^2 + y + 2) = {\\color{blue}xy \\cdot x^2 + xy \\cdot y + xy \\cdot 2} = x^3y + xy^2 + 2xy$\n\nb) $a^2b(a^2 - 2b) = {\\color{blue}a^2b \\cdot a^2 - a^2b \\cdot 2b} = a^4b - 2a^2b^2$","ef2ad0bbb5f7b9cb":"$2x(x - y)$","95a669a30208aa65":"$2x(x - y) = 2x^2 - 2xy$","f7c93e5ec52d6e27":"$-x(-y + 3)$","294fa9111d1b13ac":"$-x(-y + 3) = xy - 3x$","34b12ea5da4fa907":"$xy(x - 2)$","5e631d3bd5a41025":"$xy(x - 2) = x^2y - 2xy$","4a61b2d9139c0c88":"$-a(b^2 - a + 4) - a^2$","c72daa496bad624e":"$-a(b^2 - a + 4) - a^2 = -ab^2 + a^2 - 4a - a^2 = -ab^2 - 4a$","dbaa341847d9daaf":"$-3y(x^2 - 3x) - 2yx$","039197d70ecd69d9":"$-3y(x^2 - 3x) - 2yx = -3x^2y + 9xy - 2xy = -3x^2y + 7xy$","bd926e833a7af244":"$-u(v^3 + u)$","a0908f5f5ae3a32b":"$-u(v^3 + u) = -uv^3 - u^2 = -u^2 - uv^3$","1fd17cbb032932f3":"Multipliser kvart ledd inne i parentesen med faktoren utanfor","32db1616e553431f":"a) $2x^2 - 2xy$, b) $xy - 3x$, c) $x^2y - 2xy$, d) $-ab^2 - 4a$, e) $-3x^2y + 7xy$, f) $-u^2 - uv^3$","1658ed9f6a7c015c":"# Multiplikasjon av parentesar\n\nNår vi multipliserer to parentesar, må kvart ledd i den første parentesen multipliserast med kvart ledd i den andre.","90425b8ec57407fa":"Multiplikasjon av to parentesar","d3e51630b91cd9b9":"$$(a + b) \\cdot (c + d) = a \\cdot c + a \\cdot d + b \\cdot c + b \\cdot d$$","2d6f571d751362c1":"Døme 6","97047572b313fadb":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $(x + 2)(x + 3)$\nb) $-2(x + 3)(x - 5)$\nc) $(2x - 3)(3y - 5)$\nd) $(2x + y)(3x - 2y)$","da4010454302aaec":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $({\\color{red}x} + 2)({\\color{green}x} + 3) = {\\color{red}x} \\cdot {\\color{green}x} + {\\color{red}x} \\cdot 3 + 2 \\cdot {\\color{green}x} + 2 \\cdot 3 = x^2 + 3x + 2x + 6$\n$= x^2 + 5x + 6$\n\nb) $-2(x + 3)(x - 5) = {\\color{blue}-2(x \\cdot x + x \\cdot (-5) + 3 \\cdot x + 3 \\cdot (-5))}$\n$= -2(x^2 - 5x + 3x - 15) = -2(x^2 - 2x - 15)$\n$= -2x^2 + 4x + 30$\n\nc) $(2x - 3)(3y - 5) = {\\color{blue}2x \\cdot 3y + 2x \\cdot (-5) - 3 \\cdot 3y - 3 \\cdot (-5)}$\n$= 6xy - 10x - 9y + 15$\n\nd) $(2x + y)(3x - 2y) = {\\color{blue}2x \\cdot 3x + 2x \\cdot (-2y) + y \\cdot 3x + y \\cdot (-2y)}$\n$= 6x^2 - 4xy + 3xy - 2y^2 = 6x^2 - xy - 2y^2$","0c823999de8b7f02":"$(x + 3)(x + 4)$","9d458ba20cc3250b":"$(x + 3)(x + 4) = x^2 + 4x + 3x + 12 = x^2 + 7x + 12$","d1b618694397fed5":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)$","95db703f4cd43a24":"$(x + 3)(x - 2) = x^2 - 2x + 3x - 6 = x^2 + x - 6$","faa123263e03842a":"$(2x + 4)(x - y)$","628f0e7641f1a2ad":"$(2x + 4)(x - y) = 2x^2 - 2xy + 4x - 4y$","c807c6598cf0444f":"$-2(2x - 2)(x - 5)$","aafaf3cb9726ec54":"$-2(2x - 2)(x - 5) = -2(2x^2 - 10x - 2x + 10) = -2(2x^2 - 12x + 10) = -4x^2 + 24x - 20$","80a422010756fda2":"$-(x + y)(x - 3)$","af89181c98c5a30a":"$-(x + y)(x - 3) = -(x^2 - 3x + xy - 3y) = -x^2 + 3x - xy + 3y$","8757afe7092727eb":"$3(2x + 3y)(2y + x)$","0e165d0c516f0c41":"$3(2x + 3y)(2y + x) = 3(4xy + 2x^2 + 6y^2 + 3xy) = 3(2x^2 + 7xy + 6y^2) = 6x^2 + 21xy + 18y^2$","609adce5f76ac865":"Multipliser kvart ledd i første parentes med kvart ledd i andre parentes","63a649950f9f0498":"a) $x^2 + 7x + 12$, b) $x^2 + x - 6$, c) $2x^2 - 2xy + 4x - 4y$, d) $-4x^2 + 24x - 20$, e) $-x^2 + 3x - xy + 3y$, f) $6x^2 + 21xy + 18y^2$","77f5e20a312747a9":"Eksempel 7","50900771573699fd":"Rekn ut:\n\na) $x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 4)$\nb) $x(x + 3)(x - 5)$\nc) $(x - 2)(x - 3)(2x - 5)$","2268843ce9fbd755":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 4) = x^2 - (x^2 + 4x + 2x + 8)$\n$= x^2 - x^2 - 4x - 2x - 8 = -6x - 8$\n\nb) $x(x + 3)(x - 5) = (x^2 + 3x)(x - 5) = x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x^2 - 15x$\n$= x^3 - 2x^2 - 15x$\n\nc) $(x - 2)(x - 3)(2x - 5) = (x - 2)(2x^2 - 5x - 6x + 15)$\n$= (x - 2)(2x^2 - 11x + 15) = 2x^3 - 11x^2 + 15x - 4x^2 + 22x - 30$\n$= 2x^3 - 15x^2 + 37x - 30$","9b7571f2d0046cd7":"$x(x + 3)(x + 4)$","f12fe1c70b43f748":"$x(x + 3)(x + 4) = (x^2 + 3x)(x + 4) = x^3 + 4x^2 + 3x^2 + 12x = x^3 + 7x^2 + 12x$","1a4190e11cd32da2":"$x^2 - (x + 4)(x - 1)$","8a736d17909617f4":"$x^2 - (x + 4)(x - 1) = x^2 - (x^2 - x + 4x - 4) = x^2 - x^2 + x - 4x + 4 = -3x + 4$","adca7c3663803775":"$(x + 4)(x - 2)(x - 5)$","754cbe2ee1cc2e29":"$(x + 4)(x - 2)(x - 5) = (x^2 + 2x - 8)(x - 5) = x^3 - 5x^2 + 2x^2 - 10x - 8x + 40 = x^3 - 3x^2 - 18x + 40$","105eafbd28eae973":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)(-5)$","2bdd2df3bc2d2223":"$(x + 3)(x - 2)(-5) = -5(x^2 + x - 6) = -5x^2 - 5x + 30$","8ffe9918ef9ddd26":"$-x^3 - (x + 5)(x - 3)x$","fe5f49d6550f0ba4":"$-x^3 - (x + 5)(x - 3)x = -x^3 - (x^2 + 2x - 15)x = -x^3 - x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x = -2x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x$","2dc1034f46ae0bdb":"$x^3 - 2x - (x - 2)(x + 3)(2 + x)$","9451b4c705e69e24":"$x^3 - 2x - (x - 2)(x + 3)(2 + x) = x^3 - 2x - (x^2 + x - 6)(x + 2) = x^3 - 2x - (x^3 + 3x^2 - 4x - 12) = -3x^2 + 2x + 12$","453f4dc0b68a13e4":"Ta éin parentes om gongen. Multipliser først to parentesar, så gangar du resultatet med den tredje.","4af9b29a2bdeb0de":"a) $x^3 + 7x^2 + 12x$, b) $-3x + 4$, c) $x^3 - 3x^2 - 18x + 40$, d) $-5x^2 - 5x + 30$, e) $-2x^3 - 2x^2 + 15x$, f) $-3x^2 + 2x + 12$","f0db7f3333b88fb5":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","cc813884c5a66fe6":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","1ab25aaa0c62fda3":"$15x + 22x$","4c1af24c3bcb9304":"$12x - 4x - 20x$","12f848ad11d4d883":"$7x + 3y - 13x + 3$","09950b9a06cd783c":"$9a + b - 31a$","497d97f103646eeb":"$15x + 7q + 18 - 2$","67f6a6e00438b9b5":"$-8 - 2x - 5y - 7y$","09aeb79ba502114b":"a) $37x$, b) $-12x$, c) $-6x + 3y + 3$, d) $-22a + b$, e) $15x + 7q + 16$, f) $-2x - 12y - 8$","c365241ff1b1b831":"Saml like ledd - ledd med same bokstav og eksponent.","ce8b3b47b20ae5e1":"$4x^2 + 2x^2$","3c4d8a17c1a45636":"$2x^2 + 5x^2 - 2x$","3481e2a5603886e9":"$7xy + 3xy - 12x$","8e569cbd8cf25caa":"$2ab + 7ba + 3a$","0ffffc906bf7f3fb":"$5b^2 + 2a^2b - 6a^2b$","c168806189cc286b":"$-9xy + 8x^2 - 2x^2$","083034ac5ac0cf4a":"a) $6x^2$, b) $7x^2 - 2x$, c) $10xy - 12x$, d) $9ab + 3a$, e) $-4a^2b + 5b^2$, f) $6x^2 - 9xy$","c8d6875ca84e53b5":"Hugs at $ab = ba$. Saml like ledd.","d1898c0f50a590ff":"$3x^2 + 5x - 2x^2 + 7x - 3$","a7fdb4921e3d0e0f":"$7y^2 - 8x + 3x^2 - 7x + 9y^2$","51bdcfc412fc52da":"$2xy + 15xy - x^2 + 3xy$","d47b02fa0bee2a25":"$8a - 3c + 2a^2 - 15c - 6a$","4be99a40c835e59b":"$8ba - ab + 3a^2 - 9a^2 - 18ab$","5790d1701b894689":"$3x^2y + 10x^2y - 5x^2 + 2y^2 - 2x^2y$","3301b3de1191a5c3":"a) $x^2 + 12x - 3$, b) $3x^2 - 15x + 16y^2$, c) $-x^2 + 20xy$, d) $2a^2 + 2a - 18c$, e) $-6a^2 - 11ab$, f) $-5x^2 + 11x^2y + 2y^2$","792cf7bbd2bdd6a9":"Sorter ledda først, så blir det lettare å sjå kva som er like.","b7180e867e365013":"$5(x + 2)$","8aba13ff48a425ea":"$-2(y - 8)$","2d09177ea938ed59":"$2(2x - 3) + 5$","ab612e9dbd12f9b9":"$-3(x - 2) + 2x$","e723b1c96aebf868":"$-5(-2x + 2) + 2(x - 1)$","714f5e357db34977":"$(x - 3) \\cdot 3$","72279079478466ad":"a) $5x + 10$, b) $-2y + 16$, c) $4x - 1$, d) $-x + 6$, e) $12x - 12$, f) $3x - 9$","cce98fb5f5e60add":"Bruk distributiv lov: $a(b + c) = ab + ac$","994193c7cba174ca":"$3(3x - 3 + y)$","7f7424458170404f":"$-4(2y - 2x - 5)$","64c0ae618e9e5000":"$4(2x - 3 - 6y) + 5$","b4982c3dfd75030e":"a) $9x - 9 + 3y$, b) $8x - 8y + 20$, c) $8x - 24y - 7$","9e01b4e64cd3b4d5":"Multipliser kvart ledd inne i parentesen med faktoren utanfor.","bf1f5c575374d13e":"$3x^2(y - x)$","9cc5936b202b1d46":"$-3x(-x + 3)$","1b4212ab0ad9557a":"$x^3(x^2 - 3x)$","d7c01c120e1795c3":"$-3l(l^2 - 2l) - 2k$","4e384b44ba08a74e":"$b(-b^2 - b + 4) - b^2$","5b70f89bacbab133":"$-(x^2 - b)(x + b)$","240acbeaee37c366":"a) $3x^2y - 3x^3$, b) $3x^2 - 9x$, c) $x^5 - 3x^4$, d) $-3l^3 + 6l^2 - 2k$, e) $-b^3 - 2b^2 + 4b$, f) $-x^3 - bx^2 + bx + b^2$","a51d480d5b565803":"Bruk potensregelen $x^a \\cdot x^b = x^{a+b}$","5d50a5eecd106e45":"$(x + 2)(x + 5)$","206994b423c7ef02":"$(x - 3)(x - 4)$","d546ddca34b02c87":"$3(x + 1)(x + 2)$","4a8972b21d5ab68e":"$(2x + 1)(3x + 2)$","541c015faf97614a":"$2(2x - 2)(x + 5)$","d57feb08835185d2":"$-(x - 3)(y - 9)$","31c90d5a97ba3153":"a) $x^2 + 7x + 10$, b) $x^2 - 7x + 12$, c) $3x^2 + 9x + 6$, d) $6x^2 + 7x + 2$, e) $4x^2 + 16x - 20$, f) $-xy + 9x + 3y - 27$","0674179f269e0c97":"$(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd$","90e3f8b7489a0681":"$x(x + 2)(x + 1)$","35baaea7fc3df222":"$x^2 - (x + 2)(x + 2)$","4a4ce4c60a43dafa":"$(x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 1)$","eb391323994da219":"$(x + 5)(x + 3) \\cdot 3$","8ebc482683cbb9ee":"$-2(x - 1)(3x + 6)$","9fb1f98064ca8596":"$10 - (x + 4)(y - 2)$","ca8a932d0f89f877":"a) $x^3 + 3x^2 + 2x$, b) $-4x - 4$, c) $x^3 + 5x^2 + 7x + 3$, d) $3x^2 + 24x + 45$, e) $-6x^2 - 6x + 12$, f) $-xy + 2x - 4y + 18$","77d8184fe356754a":"Ta éin parentes om gangen. Start med å multiplisere to parentesar først.","9eeb07f9996313b8":"## Oppsummering\n\n- **Likeledd:** Berre ledd med same bokstav(ar) og same eksponent kan leggjast saman: $3x + 5x = 8x$, men $3x + 5y$ kan ikkje forenklazt\n- **Alfabetisk rekkjefølgje:** Vi skriv faktorane alfabetisk: $yx = xy$ og $ba = ab$\n- **Distributiv lov:** $a(b + c) = ab + ac$ - vi gangar faktoren utanfor parentesen med kvart ledd inne i parentesen\n- **Minus framfor parentes:** $-(a - b) = -a + b$ - alle forteikn inne i parentesen endras\n- **Multiplikasjon av to parentesar:** $(a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd$ - kvart ledd i første parentes blir multiplisert med kvart ledd i andre parentes\n- **Potensregel:** $x^n \\cdot x^m = x^{n+m}$"}}}